BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Cinema
DTSTART:20261019T213000Z
DTEND:20261019T230000Z
LOCATION:The Vault Pub - Indiana Memorial Union
SUMMARY:IU Cinema Creative Collaborations Meet & Mix
DESCRIPTION:If you are interested in applying for our next round of Creat
 ive Collaborations\, taking place in 2027–28\, this is the session for 
 you! Learn more about the program\, meet potential programming partners\,
  and enjoy tasty hors d'oeuvres at The Vault Pub!  Creative Collaboration
 s enables groups at IU and in our community to highlight important topics
  and ideas through film screenings and film-related educational programs.
   The mission of Creative Collaborations is to:Foster diverse programming
  partnerships that help bridge campus and community  Highlight critical i
 ssues and themes through film-related and educational programs curated in
  collaboration with IU Cinema and subject-matter experts  Welcome new and
  returning audiences to IU Cinema    Applications for 2027–28 program p
 roposals will be accepted from October 8–November 20\, 2026. Full progr
 am guidelines are available at go.iu.edu/creativecollaborations (https://
 cinema.indiana.edu/about/partnerships/creative-collaborations.html).Space
  for this Meet &amp\; Mix is limited. R.S.V.P. required.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  If you are interested in applying for o
 ur next round of Creative Collaborations\, taking place in 2027–28\, th
 is is the session for you! Learn more about the program\, meet potential 
 programming partners\, and enjoy tasty hors d'oeuvres at The Vault Pub!</
 p><p>  Creative Collaborations enables groups at IU and in our community 
 to highlight important topics and ideas through film screenings and film-
 related educational programs.</p><p>  The mission of Creative Collaborati
 ons is to:</p><ul><li>Foster diverse programming partnerships that help b
 ridge campus and community  </li><li>Highlight critical issues and themes
  through film-related and educational programs curated in collaboration w
 ith IU Cinema and subject-matter experts  </li><li>Welcome new and return
 ing audiences to IU Cinema  </li></ul><p>  Applications for 2027–28 pro
 gram proposals will be accepted from October 8–November 20\, 2026. Full
  program guidelines are available at <a href="https://cinema.indiana.edu/
 about/partnerships/creative-collaborations.html">go.iu.edu/creativecollab
 orations</a>.</p><p><strong>Space for this Meet &amp\; Mix is limited. R.
 S.V.P. required.</strong></p>
