SUMMARY:Hocus Pocus | CINEkids International Children's Film Series\, Jor
 gensen Guest Filmmaker Series\, Doug Jones: Of Monsters and Men
DESCRIPTION:You're in for a devil of a time when three outlandishly wild 
 witches—the Sanderson Sisters portrayed by Bette Midler\, Sarah Jessica
  Parker\, and Kathy Najimy—return from 17th-century Salem after they're
  accidentally conjured up by some unsuspecting pranksters. The 300-year-o
 ld trio set out to terrorize the town\, but first they must get their act
  together and outwit three kids and a talking cat! Co-starring Doug Jones
 \, who transforms into the good-natured zombie ex-boyfriend of Winifred S
 anderson\, William "Billy" Butcherson. [96 min\; comedy\, fantasy\; Engli
 sh]
