 ry Salem after they're accidentally conjured up by some unsuspecting pran
 ksters. The 300-year-old trio set out to terrorize the town\, but first t
 hey must get their act together and outwit three kids and a talking cat! 
 Co-starring Doug Jones\, who transforms into the good-natured zombie ex-b
 oyfriend of Winifred Sanderson\, William "Billy" Butcherson. [96 min\; co
